# Q8 — "order these triggers" without full control, and the real ordering ask
# with it. VERIFIED wave 34 — see `wave34-evidence/s3-q8.md` for the full
# account; this header has the one-line version.
#
# w33's two designs (a synthetic `activephase=UPKEEP`+`activephaseadvance=UPKEEP`
# jump, and TWO Dark Confidants driven here through ordinary priority passes)
# never got an ordering ask at all, by DESIGN, not by a test bug:
# `PlayerControllerHuman.orderSimultaneousSa` (`PlayerControllerHuman.java:2243-
# 2271`) only prompts when the simultaneous abilities' own `toString()`s
# DIFFER, or a trigger carries `OrderDuplicates$ True` — and two Dark
# Confidants are the IDENTICAL trigger text twice, so Forge decides the order
# itself and asks nothing (`needPrompt` stays false the whole loop). That is
# also why w33 never saw life drop: not a broken scenario, a real-rules
# no-op Forge is entitled to take.
#
# This file now pairs Dark Confidant with Phyrexian Arena instead — two
# DIFFERENT upkeep triggers, same controller, same timing, whose `toString()`s
# differ — which DOES hit `needPrompt = true` and produces a genuine
# `order` ask (`showRememberCheckbox: true`, two `sourceChoices`) the instant
# both triggers are queued, independent of Dark Confidant's own reveal/life
# mechanics (Phyrexian Arena's trigger body has no ambiguity of its own: draw
# one, lose 1 life, no targets, no choice).
#
# Still landing in the OPPONENT's Cleanup Step and driving Cleanup→Untap→
# Upkeep through ordinary priority passes/asks (the same mechanism every real
# game uses) — a caller must stop and read `s.asks`/the stack the MOMENT
# `Phase: Upkeep step` is reached, before auto-answering anything further, or
# the order ask (real, under full control) or its auto-answer (default
# policy) is missed.
turn=1
activeplayer=ai
activephase=CLEANUP
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Dark Confidant;Phyrexian Arena
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
